<title>Belgium: TENNIS-BELGIUM BEAT SPAIN 5-0 IN FED CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BELGIUM BEAT SPAIN 5-0 IN FED CUP.</headline>
<dateline>SPRIMONT, Belgium 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium completed a</p>
<p>5-0 victory over Spain in their Fed Cup tennis world group one,</p>
<p>first-round match after winning the doubles on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results (Belgian names first)</p>
<p>Played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Sabine Appelmans beat Arantxa Sanchez Vicario 6-3 2-6 8-6</p>
<p>Els Callens beat Maria Luisa Serna 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>Callens/Nancy Feber beat Gala Leon Garcia/Virginia</p>
<p>Ruano-Pascual 5-7 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Callens beat Sanchez Vicario 6-3 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Appelmans beat Serna 6-1 4-6 6-3</p>
</text>
